          "speaker": "clerk",
          "text": "パスポートお願いできますか？",
          "voice": "Puck",
          "speed": "fast",
          "ambience": true,
          "screen": null,
          "audio": "hotel-check-in.passport.p2.mp3"
        },
        {
          "id": "hotel-check-in.passport.p3",
          "role": "review",
          "speaker": "clerk",
          "text": "パスポートを一度お預かりしてもよろしいでしょうか？",
          "voice": "Kore",
          "speed": "normal",
          "ambience": false,
          "screen": null,
          "audio": "hotel-check-in.passport.p3.mp3"
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "a",
          "text": {
            "zh-Hant": "請給我看護照",
            "zh-Hans": "请给我看护照",
            "en": "May I see your passport"
          },
          "correct": true
        },
        {
          "id": "b",
          "text": {
            "zh-Hant": "請給我看信用卡",
            "zh-Hans": "请给我看信用卡",
            "en": "May I see your credit card"
          },
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "id": "c",
          "text": {
            "zh-Hant": "請填這張卡",
            "zh-Hans": "请填这张卡",
            "en": "Please fill in this card"
          },
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "id": "d",
          "text": {
            "zh-Hant": "請問預約的名字",
            "zh-Hans": "请问预约的名字",
            "en": "What name is the booking under"
          },
          "correct": false
        }
      ],
      "response": {
        "ja": "はい、どうぞ",
        "audio": "hotel-check-in.passport.response.mp3",
        "voice": "Orus"
      },
      "explanation": {
        "zh-Hant": "「拝見」是看，「お預かり」是先交給櫃台一下。日本的旅館通常會請外國旅客出示護照並影印，細節依規定與旅館不同，以現場說明為準。",
        "zh-Hans": "「拝見」是看，「お預かり」是先交给前台一下。日本的酒店通常会请外国旅客出示护照并复印，细节依规定与酒店不同，以现场说明为准。",
        "en": "拝見 means to look at, and お預かり means they hold it for a moment. Hotels in Japan usually ask foreign guests to show their passport and make a copy. Details depend on the rules and the hotel, so follow what the staff tell you."
      },
      "wordIds": [
        "passport"
      ],
      "reviewNote": "Passport inspection and copying for foreign guests (旅館業法 and local ordinances). Explanation stays neutral; a reviewer should confirm the wording before it can say more."
    },
    {
      "id": "hotel-check-in.registration-card",
      "kind": "listening",
      "goal": {
        "zh-Hant": "聽懂櫃台請你填住宿登記卡",
        "zh-Hans": "听懂前台请你填入住登记卡",
        "en": "Understand when you are asked to fill in the registration card"
